  /// override the permissions typically granted by assigning Quick Sight
  /// users to one of the default security cohorts in Quick Sight (admin,
  /// author, reader, admin pro, author pro, reader pro). This feature is
  /// available only to Quick Sight Enterprise edition subscriptions.
