  /// The type of permissions to use when interpreting the permissions for
  /// RLS. DENY_ACCESS is included for backward compatibility only.
  pub permission_policy: RowLevelPermissionPolicy? = None
  /// The user or group rules associated with the dataset that contains
  /// permissions for RLS. By default, FormatVersion is VERSION_1 . When
  /// FormatVersion is VERSION_1 , UserName and GroupName are required. When
  /// FormatVersion is VERSION_2 , UserARN and GroupARN are required, and
  /// Namespace must not exist.
